---
description: "Tests and smoke checks for Next.js."
globs:
  - "**/*.test.ts"
  - "**/*.test.tsx"
  - "**/*.spec.ts"
  - "scripts/smoke.*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

When adding or changing tests:

- Cover health routes and critical auth/data paths.
- Prefer deterministic unit/smoke tests over flaky e2e for CI defaults.
- Match patterns used in `examples/nextjs_live` when present.
- Do not skip failing tests to greenwash CI.
